  "name": "NSCLC Radiogenomics",
  "alternateName": [
    "nsclc_radiogenomics"
  ],
  "description": "Radiogenomics needs the same patients measured both ways, and almost no public resource provides it. This collection does: 211 patients imaged with thin-section CT and whole-body PET/CT before surgical excision, with a subset carrying matched microarray expression data deposited separately in the Gene Expression Omnibus.\nThe link between the two is recorded in the collection description as prose, not as a structured cross-reference, which is why the pairing is easy to miss. We extract that accession automatically and surface it here. Everything is openly downloadable with no account.",
  "url": "https://cancer-data-showcase.vercel.app/datasets/idc-nsclc-radiogenomics",
